                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ultrasonography.",
                                            "Medical ultrasonography."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "metonymically",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66a99910-86ec-3038-a52e-1381f65c5905",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9030ed-7520-382e-9291-e2ea8396b21c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Therapeutically applied ultrasonic energy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdfc8658-d034-4a1e-be91-669ecd86f34f",
                                                "sense_id": "66a99910-86ec-3038-a52e-1381f65c5905",
                                                "text": "Ultrasound as a treatment for degenerative arthritis was in its infancy. It might eventually turn out to be as effective as the Salk vaccine, or as bogus as the science of phrenology."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7db3ac05-bcf2-42d4-9724-436f8c8cf08a",
                                                "sense_id": "66a99910-86ec-3038-a52e-1381f65c5905",
                                                "text": "But after a few visits to share details about ultrasounds and such, Juno and Mark find they have similar interests in music and movies - and Juno does have extraordinary tastes for someone her age, from the songs of Iggy and the Stooges to the horror flicks of Dario Argento."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de8835a4-8820-4d2d-9208-9fb1be504249",
                                                "sense_id": "66a99910-86ec-3038-a52e-1381f65c5905",
                                                "text": "It’s estimated only 0.1% of antibodies circulating in the bloodstream enter the brain – this also includes the therapeutic antibodies currently used in clinical trials. An approach my team is taking is to use ultrasound to temporarily open the blood-brain barrier, which increases the uptake of Alzheimer’s drugs or antibody fragments."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
